{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work-list", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"facets": {}, "total-results": 2038637, "items": [{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7, 1]], "date-time": "2026-07-01T12:53:08Z", "timestamp": 1782910388229, "version": "3.54.5"}, "publisher-location": "Stroudsburg, PA, USA", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Association for Computational Linguistics", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "DOI": "10.18653/v1/2026.acl-long.838", "type": "proceedings-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7, 1]], "date-time": "2026-07-01T12:25:50Z", "timestamp": 1782908750000}, "page": "18407-18418", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Branch-and-Browse: Efficient and Controllable Web Exploration with Tree-Structured Reasoning and Action Memory"], "prefix": "10.18653", "author": [{"given": "Shiqi", "family": "He", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Yue", "family": "Cui", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Xinyu", "family": "Ma", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Yaliang", "family": "Li", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Bolin", "family": "Ding", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "Mosharaf", "family": "Chowdhury", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "1643", "event": {"name": "Proceedings of the 64th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (Volume 1: Long Papers)", "location": "San Diego, California, United States", "start": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7]]}, "end": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7]]}}, "container-title": ["Proceedings of the 64th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics (Volume 1: Long Papers)"], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7, 1]], "date-time": "2026-07-01T12:30:35Z", "timestamp": 1782909035000}, "score": 26.72052, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://aclanthology.org/2026.acl-long.838"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.18653/v1/2026.acl-long.838", "published": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 4, 9]], "date-time": "2026-04-09T19:02:06Z", "timestamp": 1775761326484, "version": "3.50.1"}, "posted": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "group-title": "SSRN", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Elsevier BV", "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "abstract": "<jats:p>When an AI agent needs to accomplish a task on a website, it currently navigates page by page-loading, perceiving, reasoning, and clicking through dozens of pages to reach its goal. We present Cortex, a web cartography engine that inverts this paradigm: instead of navigating a site, the agent maps it. Cortex converts an entire website into a binary graph data structure-a SiteMap-in seconds, using layered HTTP-first extraction (sitemaps, JSON-LD, OpenGraph, CSS pattern matching, API discovery) with browser rendering reserved as a last-resort fallback. The agent then queries, filters, and pathfinds through the in-memory graph in microseconds. In v1.0, the system extends the cartography model with four capabilities: a Web Compiler that infers typed schemas from maps and generates client libraries (Python, TypeScript, OpenAPI, GraphQL, MCP), a Web Query Language (WQL) providing SQL-like queries across mapped domains, a Collective Graph for delta-based map sharing with privacy stripping, and Temporal Intelligence for change tracking, pattern detection, and predictive alerts. We implement Cortex in 34,932 lines of Rust across 118 source files, with 387 tests. On an Apple M4 Pro, a 10,008-node SiteMap serializes to 5.9 MB in 134.9 ms, deserializes in 212 ms, and supports filter queries in sub-microsecond time. Pathfinding completes in 24-884 \u00b5s, and WQL full-pipeline queries execute in 9-86 \u00b5s across graphs of 107 to 10,007 nodes. On production websites, Cortex maps github.com into 1,783 nodes with 16,231 edges and 360 discovered actions, stored in a 1.2 MB binary file at 684 bytes per node.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.2139/ssrn.6267738", "type": "posted-content", "created": {"date-parts": [[2026, 4, 9]], "date-time": "2026-04-09T18:10:47Z", "timestamp": 1775758247000}, "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Cortex: Rapid Web Cartography for AI Agents via Structured Data Extraction and Binary Graph Navigation"], "prefix": "10.2139", "author": [{"given": "Omoshola", "family": "Owolabi", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"role": "author", "vocabulary": "crossref"}]}], "member": "78", "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2026, 4, 9]], "date-time": "2026-04-09T18:10:47Z", "timestamp": 1775758247000}, "score": 23.498373, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://www.ssrn.com/abstract=6267738"}}, "issued": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "references-count": 0, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.6267738", "published": {"date-parts": [[2026]]}, "subtype": "preprint"}, {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 5, 14]], "date-time": "2026-05-14T04:46:04Z", "timestamp": 1778733964854, "version": "3.51.4"}, "publisher-location": "New York, New York, USA", "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "ACM Press", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[1998, 1, 1]], "date-time": "1998-01-01T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 883612800000}, "content-version": "vor", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://www.acm.org/publications/policies/copyright_policy#Background"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[1998]]}, "DOI": "10.1145/280765.280870", "type